      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "A foundational framework connecting microscopic dynamics to thermodynamic work and entropy production far from equilibrium, with broad conceptual and experimental reach.",
        "attribution": "These names represent the work and its development from exact work relations to stochastic thermodynamics; Evans's earlier fluctuation theorem is an important antecedent, so the boundary of a three-person award needs care.",
        "maturity": "The relations have been repeatedly tested and now underpin a mature field, making the contribution well established.",
